Package: koinv-bsp-jh7110
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-riscv64, koinv-hwcaps
Recommends: koinv-bsp-jh7110-firmware, koinv-bsp-jh7110-gpu
Description: KoinV BSP for StarFive JH7110 (VisionFive 2, Milk-V Mars, Star64)
 This package provides Board Support Package for StarFive JH7110 SoC
 used in VisionFive 2, Milk-V Mars, Star64, PineTab-V, and other boards.
 .
 Includes:
  * Kernel modules for JH7110 peripherals
  * Device Tree overlays for board variants (VisionFive 2, Milk-V Mars, etc.)
  * 8GB memory override for VisionFive 2
  * PCB revision SD card overlays (v1.2B/v1.3A)
  * GPU support for Imagination BXE-4-32
  * Thermal zone configuration
  * PCIe configuration
 .
 Optional sub-package provides GPU support (proprietary firmware required).

Package: koinv-bsp-jh7110-firmware
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinv-bsp-jh7110
Description: KoinV BSP for JH7110 - Firmware blobs
 This package provides firmware blobs for JH7110 peripherals
 including PMIC, thermal, and DDR firmware.
 .
 Note: Some firmware may require separate download due to licensing.

Package: koinv-bsp-jh7110-gpu
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinv-bsp-jh7110
Description: KoinV BSP for JH7110 - GPU support (Imagination BXE-4-32)
 This package provides GPU driver support for Imagination BXE-4-32 GPU
 in JH7110 SoC.
 .
 Note: Requires proprietary Imagination driver firmware.
